## 3. How to read this

- CIs and p-values assume units are independent and were randomized as configured.
- The MDE column is the smallest true effect this sample would detect 80% of the time. Effects smaller than that can be real but undetected.
- Peeking: this report is a single fixed-horizon analysis. If you looked at the data repeatedly, use group-sequential boundaries (`xpkit.estimate.group_sequential_design`).

